      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Variable-temperature dc susceptibility (2–300 K, 1 kOe) shows χMT decreasing from 92.05 cm3 mol−1 K at room temperature to 72.74 cm3 mol−1 K at 2 K, consistent with depopulation of mJ sublevels and weak antiferromagnetic TbIII···TbIII coupling (Curie–Weiss θ = −2.42 K). ac susceptibility shows no out-of-phase signal, so 1 is not an SMM above 2.0 K.",
        "measurements": [
